{"id":12539,"date":"2025-04-14T14:21:09","date_gmt":"2025-04-14T14:21:09","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/?post_type=event&#038;p=12539"},"modified":"2025-04-14T14:21:09","modified_gmt":"2025-04-14T14:21:09","slug":"world-quantum-day-virtual-event-conversations-beyond-the-equation","status":"publish","type":"event","link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/event\/world-quantum-day-virtual-event-conversations-beyond-the-equation\/","title":{"rendered":"World Quantum Day Virtual Event: Conversations Beyond the Equation"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>World Quantum Day 2025 is here and we\u2019re excited to mark the occasion with a thought-provoking podcast session dedicated to the future of science and innovation!&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Join our&nbsp;<strong>Dr. Prince K. Osei<\/strong>, and&nbsp;<strong>Dr. Angela Tabiri<\/strong>&nbsp;as they delve into the theme:&nbsp;<strong>&#8220;From Quantum Science to Quantum Technology&#8221;,&nbsp;<\/strong>exploring its relevance for Ghana, Africa, and the next generation of STEM leaders.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This engaging conversation will highlight the growing importance of quantum education, real-world applications and efforts in building capacity within this cutting-edge space.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Don\u2019t miss out on the opportunity to gain valuable insights and be inspired!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Time: 3:00 PM GMT<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/share\/1G9rPyhPDt\/\"><strong>Channels: AIMS Ghana Facebook Liv<\/strong>e<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/events\/conversationsbeyondtheequation-7317530860541358080\/theater\/\">LinkedIn Live<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-1 wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"12540\"  src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/upl